      "created_at": "2016-12-25T22:41:36.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I decided to amuse myself by creating a diagram of the major relationships between SotM heroes. &nbsp;Unfortunately, it appears I forgot* to label the diagram! &nbsp;Can anybody help me out?</p>\n<p>I have included every hero in Sentinels of the Multiverse, including OblivAeon, but have ignored Sentinels: Tactics. &nbsp;And this is individual by character, not by hero.</p>\n<p>I obviously couldn't include every relation, so this draws primarily on relations mentioned in various bios. &nbsp;Not all of them are, though.</p>\n<p>This forum lacks decent spoiler tags, so if you could post answers in <font color=\"white\">white</font> so that they cannot be read accidentally, it would be much appreciated.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>*For various definitions of \"forgot\"</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:48:34.652Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "incoming_link_count": 25,
