      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ario/{size}/1866_2.png",
      "created_at": "2016-12-27T14:41:53.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Thank you! That's much clearer. Considering that new information it is obvious that 35 and 37 are switched. I also see that I had the wrong connection with 9 so I imagine that is one of the incorrect pairs. It would make sense for the person I thought was 9 to be 21 in connection with 7, but I don't know why the person I thought was 21 would be connected to 12. A line in the bio suggests that 9 and 25 may be switched, but 25 has solid connections where he/she is and I don't know why 9 would be connected to 28 and 19.&nbsp;</p><p>So I suppose I'll guess that 35 and 37 should be switched as well as 9 and 21.</p>",
